Description: Vietnamese SKey input method addon for Fcitx5
 Skey is a Vietnamese input method engine for the Fcitx5
 input method framework, supporting Telex, Telex W, and VNI
 with advanced surrounding text editing capabilities.
 .
 Includes:
  - skey IME addon for fcitx5
  - uinput server for fallback typing mode
  - Qt6-based settings GUI
  - skey-setup utility for automatic configuration
